<section class="ex-note" id="overview">
<h2>1. Overview（本章總覽：革蘭氏陰性球菌與桿菌感染）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Gram stain：Gram-positive 菌保留初始 crystal violet 的紫色；Gram-negative 菌被脫色後，再被 safranin 或 carbol fuchsin 染成紅色。Gram-negative 菌的 peptidoglycan 層薄，外層有 outer lipid membrane bilayer，容易被脫色步驟破壞。<span class="ex-ref">p.2782</span></li>
<li>臨床檢體中的 Gram-negative cocci 通常是 <em>Neisseria</em> spp.，依 maltose fermenting activity 區分 <em>N. meningitidis</em> 與 <em>N. gonorrhoeae</em>；Gram-negative bacilli 可依形態（coccobacilli、comma-shaped bacilli、fusiform bacilli、rods）細分，rods 還可依 lactose fermenting activity、oxidase positivity 等再分。<span class="ex-ref">p.2782</span></li>
<li>本章只談其他章節沒有涵蓋的 Gram-negative 感染之皮膚表現；許多表現來自皮膚或皮下組織的直接侵犯，也可伴隨發燒或低血壓等免疫反應徵象。<span class="ex-ref">p.2782</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Organism（病原）</th><th scope="col">Key bacteriology（細菌學特徵）</th><th scope="col">Disease（本章疾病）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><em>Neisseria meningitidis</em></td><td>Maltose-fermenting aerobic Gram-negative diplococcus；fastidious</td><td>Meningococcemia（acute／chronic）、meningitis</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>Pseudomonas aeruginosa</em></td><td>Oxidase-positive、non-lactose fermenting、obligately aerobic Gram-negative rod；單一 flagellum</td><td>Green nail、toe web infection、folliculitis、hot-foot、external otitis、bacteremia／ecthyma gangrenosum</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>Bartonella</em> spp.</td><td>Fastidious、facultative intracellular Gram-negative bacilli；常寄生於 erythrocytes</td><td>Cat scratch disease、trench fever、bacillary angiomatosis、Carrion disease</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>Salmonella</em>（Typhi、Paratyphi）</td><td>Gram-negative、oxidase-negative、flagellate rods；不發酵 lactose</td><td>Enteric fever（rose spots）</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>Klebsiella rhinoscleromatis</em></td><td><em>K. pneumoniae</em> 的亞種；lactose-fermenting Gram-negative rod</td><td>Rhinoscleroma</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>Haemophilus influenzae</em></td><td>Fastidious Gram-negative coccobacillus；需要 hemin（factor X）與 NAD（factor V）</td><td>Facial cellulitis（Hib）</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
